# Local staging area for upcoming polls.
# Raw exports (Typeform CSVs, draft TXT, working notes) live here while a poll
# is being prepared. Nothing inside ever reaches GitHub — EXCEPT this folder's
# README, which documents the workflow.
_to_publish/*
!_to_publish/README.md

